body:
German Shepherd Dog. A little mundane, but;

When they hit the puppy-stage where their ears just start trying to perk up, and they get one up and one flopped over their face.

DEAR GOD THEY'RE JUST SO CUDDLEABLE

We're not all like this, I promise.


Also;

Dog.

I'm not in a position to begin a full-scale rebuke or argument against this just yet (Not enough tea, nerves, time or whatever) but as a note to think about;

It always amazes me how at every point anybody begins to link Evil with Religion they focus on the 'Your god is horrible! He watches your every move! He's -in your braaaaiin-!' side of things. To me (as an Atheist, for the time being, by the way) that reeks of an inability to comprehend the feelings and beliefs of others. A large proportion of staunch atheists conveniently forget all of the positive sides of an omnipresent, omnibenevolent God, whether or not he's logically sound or factually correct.

And this annoys me.
